id: way-of-the-serene
name: Way of the Serene
order: 2
optionOf: quick-to-master
optionEffect: 3
description: >
  Your Dodge Rolls have their Critical Target reduced by 1 and you increase the Natural Result by 1 on all Dodge Rolls until you leave the Mindful State.
text: >
  Way of the Serene [Triggered/Mindful]: Your Dodge Rolls have their Critical Target reduced by 1 and you increase the Natural Result by 1 on all Dodge Rolls until you leave the Mindful State.

---

# Entering the Mindful State: Serene (a mark) - the Dodge's Critical Target 1 lower, its Natural Result 1 higher - till the
# State is left. Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/state/mindful, effect 3]
gain("serene-mark");
